    "text": "We're sharing new data on how AI is changing research at OpenAI.\n\nWe find researchers' AI use continues to rise exponentially, and agents are completing longer tasks, but human involvement remains central in research. Researchers are also spending more time on safety and alignment, with human effort in these areas growing faster than in any other individual research area.\n\nThis report aims to increase transparency around research acceleration and inform the governance of increasingly capable AI.",
